        510.9758605957031,
        743.9926147460938
      ],
      "text": "The second phase, We could say harvesting one, is happening in the middle\npart of the year in autumn. Bamboo stems are cutting off by the season\nworkers, collecting and sendening to the special plants during this period. In\nthe plants, what are showed a the third and the forth stages. on the diagram,\nthe bamboo stems are cutting into long strips, then produced strips are\ncrushing to make liquid pulp.\n"
